@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Bai tap da dong — 400 ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED (truoc truong rong)
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/3/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"","repositoryUrl":""}

### 2. SV002 nop bai — 201; chay lai server truoc khi chay lai toan tep
# @name createExtension
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"SV002","repositoryUrl":"https://github.com/vietdotest/EduSubmit-DTC245200604"}

### 3. Cung SV002, khong phan biet hoa thuong — 409 DUPLICATE_SUBMISSION
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":" sv002 ","repositoryUrl":"https://github.com/vietdotest/EduSubmit-DTC245200604"}

### 4. Xoa bai nop ca 2 — 204, body rong
DELETE {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createExtension.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. Xoa lai ID cu — 404 SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND
DELETE {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createExtension.response.body.$.id}}

### 6. Nop lai sau xoa — 201, GUID moi
# @name resubmitExtension
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"SV002","repositoryUrl":"https://github.com/vietdotest/EduSubmit-DTC245200604"}

### 7. Doc bai nop lai — 200; gui ca 6 truoc
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{resubmitExtension.response.body.$.id}}
